[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2704.79, "timestamp": "00:45:04", "text": "我加了一些。你做到了。  該死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2731.109, "timestamp": "00:45:31", "text": "那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2733.829, "timestamp": "00:45:33", "text": "很好。  一秒鐘。讓我再確認一下我的描述。  塔。  等等。我打算用這個。  真不敢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2740.63, "timestamp": "00:45:40", "text": "相信"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2742.79, "timestamp": "00:45:42", "text": "我要離開了。我還沒緩過"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2753.51, "timestamp": "00:45:53", "text": "神來。我也不知道為什麼。哦，等等。我70歲了。等等，發生了"}]